                  SOWCOM IS A PROGRAM FOR MULTIPHASE MULTICOMPONENT FLOW IN PERMEABLE MEDIA, INCLUDING HEAT FLOW.


 PARAMETERS FOR FLEXIBLE DIMENSIONING OF MAJOR ARRAYS (MAIN PROGRAM) ARE AS FOLLOWS

 MNEL =  50000   MNCON =  80000   MNEQ =  4   MNK =  3   MNPH =  2   MNB = 12   MNOGN =  200   MGTAB = 10000
 ===================================================================================================================================

 MAXIMUM NUMBER OF VOLUME ELEMENTS (GRID BLOCKS):            MNEL  =   50000
 MAXIMUM NUMBER OF CONNECTIONS (INTERFACES):                 MNCON =   80000
 MAXIMUM LENGTH OF PRIMARY VARIABLE ARRAYS:                  MPRIM =  200000
 MAXIMUM NUMBER OF GENERATION ITEMS (SINKS/SOURCES):         MNOGN =     200
 MAXIMUM NUMBER OF TABULAR (TIME-DEPENDENT) GENERATION DATA: MGTAB =   10000
 LENGTH OF SECONDARY PARAMETER ARRAY:                        MSEC  = 8000000
 MAXIMUM NUMBER OF JACOBIAN MATRIX ELEMENTS:                 MNZ   = 3360000

 LARGE LINEAR EQUATION ARRAYS: LENGTH OF IRN IS              LIRN  = 3360000
                               LENGTH OF ICN AND CO IS       LICN  = 3360000

 ===================================================================================================================================

 array dimensioning is made according to the needs of the conjugate gradient solvers
 when using LUBAND, only a smaller-size problem can be accommodated
 restriction with MA28 is: {number of elements} + 2 * {number of connections} < {MNEL + 2* MNCON}/4

 ===================================================================================================================================


